- Search or hydrate relevant memory before high-impact work.
- Route every write through `l9-memory`, MCP `memory.ingest`, or `MemoryService`.
- Never write directly to SQLite, Graphiti, Zep, or a provider SDK.
- Treat search status `partial` or `failed` as operational evidence, not an empty memory result.
